From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: BiSheng <raft-mobile-bisheng@mail.build>
Date: Tue, 29 Sep 2026 06:09:55 +0000
Subject: fix(ohos): decode Canvas images into validated SDR shared-memory
 pixelmaps

Canvas images were decoded with dynamic range AUTO, so HDR sources produced
hardware/surface-buffer pixelmaps that OH_Drawing could not read. Decode as
SDR RGBA_8888 into shared memory (API 15 allocator decoder is a weak symbol,
keeping the API 12-14 floor), validate that the result is CPU-readable
before caching it, and guard Canvas drawImage against missing modules and
failed pixelmap conversion.

Fork-Patch: ohos-canvas-sdr-pixelmap
Origin: a318e892 b57fc344
Upstream-Status: pending
Signed-off-by: BiSheng <raft-mobile-bisheng@mail.build>

